  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Qi Xiang left the killer move unlimited qi sea behind, resulting in Qi Xiang grotto-heaven surviving many myriad tribulations after his death. Most rank eight Gu Immortals in the world do not even dare to challenge their first myriad tribulation and desperately delay time in their immortal aperture, but Qi Xiang grotto-heaven’s heavenly spirit can use this move to get past myriad tribulations again and again. After annexing this grotto-heaven, Fang Yuan uses the light of wisdom to modify unlimited qi sea before the fate war.",
      "chapters": [
        2052
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qi_xiang",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan annexed Qi Xiang grotto-heaven, the sovereign immortal aperture gained a huge boost of qi path dao marks. Currents started to appear all over the immortal aperture. There was the largest quantity of heaven and earth qi, so for a time the sovereign immortal aperture had no need to open its entrance and absorb external heaven and earth qi. Profound yin qi, luck qi, blood qi, astral qi, domination qi, life qi, death qi, righteous qi, orchid vitality qi, elderly qi, and other immortal materials followed.",
      "chapters": [
        2109
